      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/c/csm_header_presetting_805b97e0b6.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tool Presetting &amp; Measuring</h2> <p>Reduce set-up times <br/>by 40 % and more.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/presetting-measuring\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/0/csm_teaser_toolmanagement_7103509fb4.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tool Management</h2> <p>Get the most out of <br/>your tools and tool data <br/>with tool storage, software, <br/>and error-free data transfer.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/tool-management\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/7/csm_teaser_inspection_8db5d700b8.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tool Inspection &amp; Measuring</h2> <p>Document tool quality and <br/>create digital twins.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/inspection-measuring\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/3/csm_teaser_shrinking_f763ceca8f.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tool Heat Shrink Technology</h2> <p>Shrink and unshrink <br/>tools, in record time.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/shrink-technology\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/b/csm_teaser_tooling_b7ac4272bd.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tooling Solutions</h2> <p>Tool holders with »idChip« have the perfect <br/>interface for your digital production.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/tooling-solutions\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/01_Pages/Solutions/Automation/zoller_automation_komp.mp4",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Automation for the Shop Floor</h2> <p>From setting, measuring and inspecting tools to the complete <br/>automation of your tool processes - ZOLLER has the solution.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/automation\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/8/csm_teaser_balancing_a6279efe6e.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Tool Balancing Technology</h2> <p>Protect spindles and ensure quality <br/>with the best tool balancing devices on the market.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/balancing-technology\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/1/csm_teaser_solution_steinbearbeitung_e8c492c5c9.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>Stone CNC Machining</h2> <p>Prepare diamond tools faster and <br/>produce contours even more efficiently.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/solutions/stone-cnc-machining\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "full": false
